    # Manual software pipeline: prefetch tile N+1 while computing/storing tile N.
    # Keeps only 2 live buffers (fits Unified Buffer) yet overlaps the HBM load
    # latency behind the compute-bound acos vec sequence better than a grouped
    # unroll. The tile arange is hoisted and offsets advance by a running stride
    # to minimize per-iteration address arithmetic (exposed scalar overhead).
